no longer an APIException.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WMHrjRkMgotZngQzt31zSK\\n\\n---------\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\",\"authorName\":\"dkayiwa\",\"authorEmail\":\"dkayiwa@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"a69b14a84bf925ff7cdf34e93ca1ffb4f257265f\",\"date\":\"2026-10-08T15:44:45+02:00\",\"message\":\"TRUNK-6799 Introduce Spring Security with support for legacy authentication context (#6544)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\",\"authorName\":\"Rafal Korytkowski\",\"authorEmail\":\"rafal.korytkowski@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"a48d5d8a398069f34955affb6f783b79f122423a\",\"date\":\"2026-09-03T16:31:56-04:00\",\"message\":\"TRUNK-6698 & TRUNK-6776: Cache @Authorized metadata and add tests for class hierarchy (#6508)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Ian\",\"authorEmail\":\"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com\"},{\"hash\":\"c4aca3af4154dc99969cb6aed48a1e71c9a70055\",\"date\":\"2026-07-01T11:17:09+02:00\",\"message\":\"Porting TRUNK-6429 and TRUNK-6515 to master (#6233)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* TRUNK-6429: Create application events for service method calls and entity changes (#6084)\\n\\n(cherry picked from commit 144fee399f79b7152f2fcbaade069a7cfd3285e3)\\n\\n* TRUNK-6516: Provide CDC mechanism with Debezium (#6151)\\n\\n(cherry picked from commit 57f4018ffbcdb27dac86677ca2791d9fae6cfc89)\\n\\n* TRUNK-6429: Addressing post commit review (#6190)\\n\\n(cherry picked from commit a4331e297c2ad33b9d615174f7b6e52b26ef236c)\",\"authorName\":\"Rafal Korytkowski\",\"authorEmail\":\"rafal.korytkowski@gmail.com\"}],\"totalCount\":4}"}],"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_019YXoEapTKCsX8QDhQuHZVb","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
